      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "N.B. Steam beta branch is reported incorrectly in the logs as `unity-6`; my `Build 1885` install from the usual location is unity-6, but I am launching an Unity 2022.3.22f2, VRChat 2026.2.3p3 `Build 1867` as a \"non-Steam game\".",
